  "title": "Avery Dennison® Launches Neo™ Matte Black Paint Protection Film | Avery Dennison | Graphics",
  "summary": "Avery Dennison® has announced the release of Neo™ Matte Black Paint Protection Film (PPF), an exciting addition to its premium wet-apply color PPF line. This highly anticipated film joins the successful Neo™ Noir Gloss Black PPF to give installers and car enthusiasts the two most popular black aesthetics backed by superior protection.",
